[0.049, "o", "\u001b[2;52H\u001b[48;2;38;38;38m  \u001b[C      \u001b[C      \u001b[2C  \u001b[C       \u001b[2C  \u001b[C   \u001b[2C  \u001b[C     \u001b[3;52H\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m·\u001b[2C1.\u001b[C\u001b[39m\u001b[2mSuperpowers writes \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdocs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-04-foo-design.md\u001b[39m and\u001b[4;52H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[48;2;38;38;38m      \u001b[2mends\u001b[Cits turn with \"Pl\u001b[Case review it\".\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[48;2;38;38;38m \u001b[C      \u001b[5;52H\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m·\u001b[2C2.\u001b[C\u001b[39m\u001b[2mThe mod has seen the \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mWrite\u001b[39m, matched the path, and seen the review phrase\u001b[6;52H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[48;2;38;38;38m \u001b[2C   \u001b[2min \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mturn.complete\u001b[39m. It opens the review pane focused (or, on a narrow\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[48;2;38;38;38m       \u001b[7;58H\u001b[2mterminal, posts a toast and status line: \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mSpec ready: press /doc-review\u001b[39m).\u001b[8;55H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u001b[48;2;38;38;38m3.\u001b[39m \u001b[2mThe p\u001b[Cne\u001b[Cs\u001b[Cows\u001b[Ct\u001b[Ce documen\u001b[2Crendered as markdown. Each block is a\u001b[Cfocus\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[48;2;38;38;38m                              \u001b[9;55H   \u001b[2mstop. The focused block is drawn with \u001b[38;2;177;185;249minverse\u001b[39m or a left bar. A one-line\u001b[10;58Hlegend sits at the bottom:\u001b[11;52H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[48;2;38;38;38m \u001b[2C          \u001b[12;52H\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m·\u001b[2C\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   Tab/Shift+Tab move  ·  Enter comment  ·  a ask  ·  s submit review  ·  o approve  ·  Esc close\u001b[13;52H\u001b[39m \u001b[2C                                                                             \u001b[14;52H\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m·\u001b[2C4.\u001b[39m \u001b[2mEnter\u001b[Con a\u001b[Cblock opens\u001b[Can \u001b[Cnline c\u001b[Cmposer under it (a\u001b[2C\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mInput\u001b[39m with\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[48;2;38;38;38m          \u001b[15;55H   \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[2mautoFocus\u001b[39m). The user typ\u001b[Cs\u001b[Ca comment and presses Ent\u001b[Cr. The comment is\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[48;2;38;38;38m    \u001b[16;55H   \u001b[2mpinned under the block, dim, prefixed with a marker. No model call yet.\u001b[17;52H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u001b[48;2;38;38;38m·\u001b[2C5.\u001b[C\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[2ma\u001b[39m on a block opens the same composer in ask mode. Enter sends the\u001b[18;52H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[48;2;38;38;38m \u001b[2C   \u001b[2mquestion\u001b[Cthrough \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m$.model.fork\u001b[39m with the quoted block as the first line of\u001b[19;58Hthe prompt. The answer streams in under the block. Nothing enters the main\u001b[20;52H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[48;2;38;38;38m \u001b[2C   \u001b[2mtranscrip\u001b[C. The exchange is kept on the block and can be\u001b[2Curned \u001b[Cnto a\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[48;2;38;38;38m   \u001b[21;55H   \u001b[2mcomment with one press.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[48;2;38;38;38m                                                \u001b[22;52H\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m·\u001b[2C6.\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[2ms\u001b[39m submits t\u001b[Ce rev\u001b[Cew. The mod builds one prompt from all pinned comments,\u001b[23;58Heach anchored by heading path and quoted text, and calls\u001b[24;52H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[48;2;38;38;38m \u001b[2C   \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[2m$.prompt.submit\u001b[39m. The model revises the document in the main conversation\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[48;2;38;38;38m                               \u001b[25;55H   \u001b[2mas usual. The pane stays open and refreshes on the next \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mWrite\u001b[39m/\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mEdit\u001b[39m.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[48;2;38;38;38m                                    \u001b[26;52H\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m·\u001b[2C7.\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u00